snippet.textDisplay:
If you are afflicted by someone who breaks covenants and rejects the truth, then know that God is sufficient as a defender for you, as long as your faith in Him remains strong.

{Indeed, God defends those who believe. Indeed, God does not love any treacherous ingrate.}

"Indeed, God defends those who believe." Beware of transgressing, attacking, or defaming anyone... for God, the Most High, the Exalted, defends them.

"Indeed, God defends those who believe." Your Lord defends you, so defend His religion.

"Indeed, God defends those who believe." You are not alone; the Almighty, the Strong, defends you according to the strength of your faith.

Reflect on {Indeed, God defends those who believe} when God, the Almighty, is the One who takes charge. Defending you;

How wretched are those who oppose you!

-(Indeed, Allah defends those who believe.) Do not be alarmed or distressed. If this verse settles in your heart, it will find peace.-The defense of a servant is according to his faith. Allah Almighty says: {Indeed, Allah defends those who believe.} So if the defense weakens, it is due to a deficiency in his faith.
-The most difficult accusation you face is the one plotted behind your back, against which you have no power to defend yourself. All you need to do is be a believer. {Indeed, Allah defends those who believe.}
-{Indeed, Allah defends those who believe.} Ibn al-Qayyim, may Allah have mercy on him, said: His defense of them is according to the strength and perfection of their faith. The Uyghur people are oppressed Muslims, stripped of their rights. Their daughters and women have been raped, their children kidnapped, and they have been imprisoned without cause. They have been prevented from practicing their Islamic rituals, forced to drink alcohol, their women's veils removed, and their children orphaned. And you think that you Do not punish, for God is severe in anger when a person is wronged unjustly, and His anger intensifies when a Muslim believer is killed unjustly. So what about an entire nation? The countries that despise Muslims will disappear from the face of the earth, and this is God's promise in the Quran. This is the truth, and whoever wants to be sure should look into history and see the reasons why cities were submerged and others perished in an instant.

